enhanced durability and performance compared to the original F4 1S 5A AIO F=
C. With a 1mm-thick board, it=E2=80=99s more rugged than the 0.8mm-thick F4=
 1S 5A AIO board, and its built-in motor connectors simplify installation, =
eliminating the need for welding. With the advanced G473 processor and 5IN1=
 configuration, including a <span>5.8GHz </span>400mW VTX, the Matrix 1S is=
 a better choice for beginners. For advanced pilots seeking a extremely lig=
htweight, race-focused experience, the&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/=
products/air-brushless-flight-controller?variant=3D41142912745606" rel=3D"n=
oopener" target=3D"_blank">Air Brushless FC 5IN1 version</a> is the best ch=
oice.</p>
